WEBVTT

00:04.421 --> 00:05.922
[intriguing music playing]

00:08.633 --> 00:12.095
MEOTO ZENZAI

00:19.728 --> 00:20.812
[Tetsujo] Dokuga.

00:20.895 --> 00:23.815
Tetsujo. How's Risu?

00:23.898 --> 00:25.817
Well, he's sleeping for now.

00:26.776 --> 00:27.736
All right.

00:30.363 --> 00:32.866
[Tetsujo] Dokuga, you know, don't you?

00:33.575 --> 00:35.118
You know who killed Risu?

00:36.411 --> 00:40.081
Yeah. I saw him die with my own two eyes.

00:41.332 --> 00:43.084
Then... who did it?

00:43.668 --> 00:45.587
- [uneasy music playing]
- Huh?

00:50.175 --> 00:53.553
This letter plane is from Kento.

00:54.554 --> 00:56.556
[frantic electronic music playing]

01:08.943 --> 01:10.695
[lyrics in Japanese]

02:20.974 --> 02:22.308
[music fades]

02:22.392 --> 02:23.935
THE BEGINNING

02:24.018 --> 02:25.520
[ragged breathing]

02:27.272 --> 02:31.776
[Kento] Boss, we made you your favorite.
Please enjoy it.

02:32.277 --> 02:35.905
I was able to obtain
some really wonderful parts today.

02:35.989 --> 02:37.866
[ragged breathing]

02:39.284 --> 02:41.035
The Black Powder has run out,

02:41.119 --> 02:43.913
and our organization
has weakened significantly.

02:44.455 --> 02:46.958
But this time,
we can take advantage of this woman...

02:47.041 --> 02:49.085
[sniffing]

02:49.169 --> 02:50.211
Hmm?

02:50.795 --> 02:52.714
[Noi] Hey, that smells pretty good!

02:53.298 --> 02:55.592
[gasps] Ravioli? Yeah!

02:55.675 --> 02:56.551
[both gasp]

02:56.634 --> 02:57.468
Damn it!

02:57.552 --> 02:59.721
What the hell's this? [gasps]

02:59.804 --> 03:01.681
[yelling ferociously]

03:01.764 --> 03:02.640
[gasps]

03:03.183 --> 03:04.225
[grunts]

03:05.101 --> 03:05.977
[growling]

03:06.060 --> 03:08.855
Damn, that's close! [gasps]

03:08.938 --> 03:11.357
Bastard! Where'd you get that mask?!

03:11.858 --> 03:12.817
[laughs]

03:12.901 --> 03:15.862
As you can see,
this mask belonged to your partner.

03:15.945 --> 03:18.615
Taking you hostage
made it real easy to kill him.

03:18.698 --> 03:20.950
[gasping] No way.

03:21.826 --> 03:23.870
Shin is... He's dead?!

03:25.121 --> 03:26.414
[gasps, grunts]

03:26.497 --> 03:28.082
[tense music playing]

03:28.166 --> 03:29.792
[aggressive grunting]

03:30.627 --> 03:32.295
I'll kill you!

03:32.378 --> 03:33.546
[man grunts painfully]

03:34.130 --> 03:35.590
[Noi yelling ferociously]

03:37.133 --> 03:38.384
[pained groaning]

03:42.388 --> 03:45.183
[pained grunting]

03:46.517 --> 03:47.644
[strangled groan]

03:48.394 --> 03:50.021
[wheezy gasping]

03:51.105 --> 03:52.815
B... Boss...

03:52.899 --> 03:53.816
Huh?

03:53.900 --> 03:55.860
[labored breathing] Help me...

03:58.321 --> 04:00.698
I don't want to die...

04:04.285 --> 04:06.412
Help me!

04:07.163 --> 04:09.457
[gasping]

04:14.462 --> 04:17.465
I don't think Noi's here.

04:17.548 --> 04:18.383
Uh?

04:19.384 --> 04:20.260
Shin!

04:21.386 --> 04:23.805
Oh man, your body's so cold.

04:23.888 --> 04:26.474
[weakly] Noi... We have to find her...

04:26.557 --> 04:28.101
But I've gotta help you!

04:28.184 --> 04:29.352
- [distant thud]
- Huh?

04:31.104 --> 04:33.022
- Shin, look!
- [groans weakly]

04:35.108 --> 04:36.025
[gasps]

04:36.109 --> 04:37.652
Noi! Are you...

04:37.735 --> 04:39.153
[music intensifies]

04:42.740 --> 04:44.534
[gasping]

04:47.370 --> 04:49.205
[gasping]

04:49.872 --> 04:51.082
[music fades]

04:55.461 --> 04:58.298
[Shin roaring]

05:00.842 --> 05:02.760
[yelling angrily]

05:11.144 --> 05:13.813
[pained groaning]

05:15.773 --> 05:18.609
- Too slow for me, you giant freak!
- [pained growling]

05:18.693 --> 05:21.279
[gasps, whimpers]

05:22.488 --> 05:24.240
Giant transformation magic?

05:24.324 --> 05:25.992
- [impacts landing in distance]
- Huh?

05:28.077 --> 05:30.496
[crazed yelling]

05:30.580 --> 05:32.498
[pained groaning]

05:32.582 --> 05:33.583
[Shin] Noi!

05:34.083 --> 05:36.502
Okay. You're still alive.

05:37.253 --> 05:41.132
Hey, mister, what are you doing up there?

05:44.969 --> 05:47.305
Oh, wait. This is wax.

05:47.388 --> 05:50.600
- Huh?
- [pained growling]

05:53.186 --> 05:55.855
- [Shin] Kasukabe! What are you doing?
- Huh?!

05:55.938 --> 05:58.149
It's all collapsing! Get out!

05:58.232 --> 05:59.567
[screams unsteadily]

06:01.069 --> 06:02.320
[music stops]

06:11.204 --> 06:12.997
[glass shattering]

06:13.664 --> 06:18.586
[Kento] Come back, Boss.

06:19.087 --> 06:20.505
[Shin coughing]

06:21.381 --> 06:22.632
Kasukabe?

06:25.385 --> 06:27.720
Kasukabe, no...

06:28.221 --> 06:29.263
[groans weakly]

06:29.806 --> 06:32.141
[Kasukabe] Ouch, ouch, ouch, ouch, ouch...

06:32.934 --> 06:33.768
Huh?

06:35.353 --> 06:36.437
No way.

06:36.521 --> 06:37.772
That face...

06:38.564 --> 06:40.775
It looks just like him.

06:42.193 --> 06:44.695
But... but why...

06:45.488 --> 06:47.031
[unsettling music playing]

06:50.827 --> 06:51.828
[Haru] Hayes?

06:52.787 --> 06:53.913
Hayes?

06:54.497 --> 06:55.665
Hayes, wake up.

06:56.165 --> 06:57.208
Who's that?

06:57.917 --> 07:00.002
I left that name in the past.

07:01.003 --> 07:01.921
Wake up.

07:02.004 --> 07:02.922
Haru?

07:03.506 --> 07:05.091
- Hayes.
- [Kasukabe gasps]

07:05.174 --> 07:07.218
[Haru] It's been quite a while, Hayes.

07:07.301 --> 07:10.680
I didn't recognize you at first
because you look like this.

07:10.763 --> 07:13.433
It's been a while
since I woke up my husband.

07:13.516 --> 07:14.392
What?!

07:14.475 --> 07:15.685
[nostalgic music playing]

07:15.768 --> 07:18.938
[Haru] I was flying through the sky
and picked up a nostalgic scent.

07:19.439 --> 07:21.065
I also noticed,

07:21.149 --> 07:23.943
it seems you're still
writing books under my name,

07:24.026 --> 07:25.695
Professor Kasukabe.

07:26.320 --> 07:27.947
Haru, you're...

07:28.531 --> 07:31.451
Yeah. I actually became a devil.

07:31.534 --> 07:34.162
It had always been a dream of mine.

07:34.245 --> 07:36.330
So, I took the devil exam.

07:37.039 --> 07:40.001
But I couldn't return to the Hole
looking like this...

07:40.084 --> 07:42.086
That was a horrible thing I did to you.

07:43.838 --> 07:44.755
It's fine.

07:45.256 --> 07:47.091
I'm just glad to know you're alive.

07:47.592 --> 07:49.594
Here, this is yours, I believe.

07:53.931 --> 07:55.683
[Haru] Thank you, Hayes.

08:00.897 --> 08:01.981
[both gasping]

08:02.064 --> 08:05.109
What are... Whoa!
It all burned to the ground!

08:05.193 --> 08:07.320
That explains why it felt so hot in there.

08:07.403 --> 08:09.113
- [Kasukabe] Hey, you guys!
- [both] Huh?

08:09.197 --> 08:10.740
Are you both okay?

08:10.823 --> 08:12.325
[Thirteen and Risu] Professor!

08:13.284 --> 08:15.620
[Thirteen] Oh! It's Shin and his partner!

08:15.703 --> 08:18.998
Is it possible
they both died trying to save us?

08:19.081 --> 08:22.043
They're fine.
Thankfully, they're both still alive.

08:22.126 --> 08:23.211
It's a shame.

08:23.294 --> 08:26.422
After all we've been through,
you still didn't get to see your wife.

08:26.506 --> 08:29.091
Nah. I did see her.

08:31.511 --> 08:33.513
- [Johnson chittering happily]
- Huh?

08:35.932 --> 08:37.350
[loud, clanging thud]

08:39.477 --> 08:42.522
So tell me,
how long have you known about Nikaido?

08:42.605 --> 08:44.524
- [loud thud]
- [tense music playing]

08:51.113 --> 08:52.365
Why did you choose

08:52.448 --> 08:56.035
to keep "The Sorcerer
Who Can Manipulate Time" hidden from us?

08:56.619 --> 08:58.829
Answer me, Asu.

08:59.372 --> 09:00.790
[loud thud]

09:06.504 --> 09:09.423
[Asu] I doubt
that a natural-born devil like you

09:09.507 --> 09:12.426
could ever understand, Chidaruma.

09:13.553 --> 09:14.679
[Chidaruma] Very well.

09:16.013 --> 09:17.807
[uneasy music playing]

09:17.890 --> 09:19.725
[ding]

09:25.898 --> 09:29.026
[Caiman] Oh, come on!
What even is this place?

09:29.110 --> 09:31.404
It's deader than dead around here!

09:31.904 --> 09:35.866
What the hell was he thinking,
sending us here? Stupid pig-faced devil!

09:35.950 --> 09:40.288
Caiman, don't you think Asu
deliberately chose a deserted area?

09:40.371 --> 09:42.248
It's game over if En finds us.

09:42.331 --> 09:44.834
Hey, don't forget
that Magic doesn't work on me!

09:44.917 --> 09:46.711
So I'm not afraid at all!

09:47.420 --> 09:50.506
Yeah, well, Asu said
if I were to meet En now,

09:50.590 --> 09:53.843
I'll become his partner again and you
and I will be back to being enemies.

09:54.594 --> 09:55.678
[sighs]

09:55.761 --> 09:58.848
Well, I for sure don't want you
as my enemy ever again.

09:59.348 --> 10:01.684
If that wasn't enough,
that heart-faced bastard

10:01.767 --> 10:03.227
is a real pain too.

10:04.103 --> 10:06.272
[Nikaido] Asu, I hope you're okay.

10:06.772 --> 10:07.607
Huh?

10:08.649 --> 10:09.525
Caiman.

10:10.067 --> 10:12.570
[Caiman] Ain't this a subway entrance?

10:14.739 --> 10:16.365
Mastema?

10:17.283 --> 10:18.367
Mastema...

10:18.451 --> 10:22.371
This is the town where En fought
the Cross-Eyed boss six years ago.

10:26.667 --> 10:29.253
[shocked gasp] It's a shopping mall!

10:29.337 --> 10:31.422
[intriguing music playing]

10:32.423 --> 10:35.843
Hey, this place feels like the Hole,
don't ya think?

10:35.926 --> 10:38.346
We might be able to get
some weapons and clothes.

10:38.429 --> 10:41.807
[Caiman] But we don't have any money,
so we'll have to rob people again.

10:41.891 --> 10:43.351
[Nikaido] That or shoplift, I guess.

10:43.434 --> 10:44.852
[sighs]

10:44.935 --> 10:46.062
[Nikaido] Caiman.

10:46.145 --> 10:49.482
Stay alert. There's somebody
in this place trying to follow us.

10:49.565 --> 10:50.399
[Caiman] Really?

10:58.866 --> 10:59.825
[girl] Huh? What?

11:00.618 --> 11:01.494
Damn it.

11:02.119 --> 11:04.330
[yelps, grunting]

11:04.413 --> 11:07.833
All right, who the hell are you?
Why are you trying to follow us?

11:07.917 --> 11:10.836
Wait, no! You don't understand.
I'm one of you!

11:10.920 --> 11:12.797
One of what?

11:12.880 --> 11:14.423
- [Nikaido] Caiman.
- Huh?

11:14.507 --> 11:15.841
Let her go.

11:15.925 --> 11:16.967
[screams]

11:17.051 --> 11:17.968
[thud]

11:18.552 --> 11:21.013
Oh man, that hurt! Ouch!

11:21.097 --> 11:22.723
[Nikaido] Tell us who you are.

11:22.807 --> 11:25.226
I'm one of you guys! See?

11:25.309 --> 11:26.227
[both gasp]

11:27.019 --> 11:29.730
Although I only got it tattooed
on my eye a week ago.

11:30.773 --> 11:31.732
[both] Uh...

11:33.192 --> 11:37.113
I've never seen either of you
around here before. Are you new to town?

11:37.196 --> 11:40.032
I work for Mr. Maki.
I'm one of his pushers.

11:40.116 --> 11:41.117
I'm Natsuki.

11:41.200 --> 11:44.120
Well, I guess you could say
I'm more of a rookie dealer.

11:44.704 --> 11:47.540
- So you guys came to see Mr. Maki, right?
- [Caiman] Huh?

11:47.623 --> 11:49.792
[Nikaido] Just play along
with her, Caiman.

11:49.875 --> 11:53.379
Ah, yeah! That's right! How's Maki doin'?

11:53.462 --> 11:57.383
Sales really haven't been great lately,
so he's not looking very well. Oh!

11:57.466 --> 11:58.884
Sorry, business calls!

11:58.968 --> 12:01.470
Please wait here, won't you?
I'll be right back.

12:06.976 --> 12:09.729
What the hell?
What do you think she's selling?

12:09.812 --> 12:12.773
Thanks for waiting!
I'll go and get Mr. Maki.

12:12.857 --> 12:16.277
Actually, before you do that,
there's something I want to ask of you.

12:16.360 --> 12:17.653
PAWN SHOP

12:17.737 --> 12:20.823
Yo! Old Hag! Sell these people
some weapons and clothes, okay?

12:20.906 --> 12:24.535
- Ooh!
- Whoa! All right!

12:24.618 --> 12:27.455
[Natsuki] According to rumors,
some of the stuff here was actually sold

12:27.538 --> 12:30.207
by the Cross-Eyes boss
and his closest men!

12:30.291 --> 12:31.375
Ooh!

12:31.876 --> 12:34.086
[Natsuki] Well, take your time
and have a look around.

12:34.170 --> 12:35.588
I've got to go to work!

12:37.298 --> 12:38.674
[Caiman] Oh, come on!

12:38.758 --> 12:41.927
There's nothing in this place
that fits me, damn it!

12:42.011 --> 12:44.555
[Nikaido] I've already made
my choice, Caiman!

12:45.389 --> 12:46.390
[chuckles]

12:46.891 --> 12:48.809
[Caiman] I need some more time!

12:48.893 --> 12:51.103
Come on... Let's see...

12:52.396 --> 12:56.317
Hey, old hag! What have you got hidden
inside this old wicker trunk?

12:56.400 --> 12:57.568
[old hag] I don't know.

12:57.651 --> 13:00.738
Anything that's not unpacked
is the same as it was sold to me.

13:01.238 --> 13:03.073
[tuts] How sloppy.

13:03.699 --> 13:04.575
Ooh!

13:05.159 --> 13:07.077
[humming] Huh?

13:07.161 --> 13:09.622
Mr. Maki! Perfect timing!

13:09.705 --> 13:11.290
Some people came looking for you--

13:12.041 --> 13:15.669
[Maki] Natsuki! You little shit!
You've been slacking off again!

13:15.753 --> 13:17.546
[chuckles] My bad...

13:17.630 --> 13:18.714
[scoffs]

13:18.798 --> 13:21.926
Listen, Natsuki. Things are gonna get
real busy from now on.

13:22.009 --> 13:23.427
Look at this!

13:23.511 --> 13:26.639
We're gonna sell all of this stuff
in Mastema, 'kay?

13:27.139 --> 13:29.308
[gasps] That's Black Powder?!

13:29.391 --> 13:30.810
Where did you get so much?!

13:30.893 --> 13:31.769
Oh?

13:32.269 --> 13:34.313
The grains are rough. Mr. Maki...

13:34.396 --> 13:36.023
Aren't you the sharp one?

13:36.106 --> 13:38.609
- You're right, this powder's all fake.
- Huh?!

13:38.692 --> 13:40.945
[Maki] The boss has been gone
for several years now,

13:41.028 --> 13:43.113
so all the real stuff has finally run out.

13:43.197 --> 13:45.074
The people in Mastema are idiots,

13:45.157 --> 13:47.368
so they're gonna pay me big bucks
for this crap.

13:47.451 --> 13:48.953
But you can't!

13:49.036 --> 13:52.623
The Cross-Eyes invented the Black Powder
to help those who couldn't use Magic...

13:52.706 --> 13:56.752
The only reason people join the Cross-Eyes
is because they want to make some money.

13:56.836 --> 13:58.003
Wasn't that the same for you?

13:58.087 --> 14:01.507
No! No, it's not!
I don't care about the money at all!

14:02.216 --> 14:03.759
There's no way I'm going to help you!

14:05.094 --> 14:10.516
Bastard! All the kindness I've shown you,
and this is how you repay me?! Natsuki!

14:10.599 --> 14:12.893
[Caiman] Hey, hey, easy buddy!

14:13.477 --> 14:14.770
What's goin' on?

14:15.479 --> 14:19.149
What? Who the hell are you?
I've never seen you here before.

14:19.233 --> 14:21.443
Ha! Who the hell am I?

14:21.527 --> 14:23.654
That's a good question. I don't even know!

14:23.737 --> 14:27.283
[Maki] Wait a minute... Don't tell me
you're one of Dokuga's men!

14:27.366 --> 14:29.368
Are you trying to interfere
with my business--

14:29.451 --> 14:30.536
[pained grunt]

14:30.619 --> 14:31.662
Huh?

14:31.745 --> 14:32.913
[gasps]

14:34.123 --> 14:36.125
- [panting]
- [Maki] You're a little piece of shit!

14:36.709 --> 14:38.043
[yells angrily]

14:38.127 --> 14:38.961
[screams]

14:39.044 --> 14:40.504
I'm gonna kill you!

14:43.507 --> 14:46.010
You wanna fight, do ya?! [grunting]

14:48.429 --> 14:49.263
[pained yell]

14:50.306 --> 14:52.474
[shocked, pained grunting] Huh?

14:53.434 --> 14:54.310
[splutters]

14:55.311 --> 14:56.729
[whimper]

14:59.481 --> 15:01.108
[jaunty music playing]

15:01.650 --> 15:04.528
Oh, Mr. Maki. I'm sorry for you.

15:05.029 --> 15:08.282
I heard that real Cross-Eyes members
are actually incredible in fights

15:08.365 --> 15:09.533
when they're using knives.

15:10.492 --> 15:12.745
You're strong,
so you're the real deal, right?

15:12.828 --> 15:16.206
I don't know, kid!
Just leave me alone and go home.

15:16.290 --> 15:17.541
Quit the Cross-Eyes too.

15:17.625 --> 15:20.794
[Natsuki] No chance! I've just decided
I'm going to tag along with you,

15:20.878 --> 15:22.880
then I'll meet the boss one day!

15:22.963 --> 15:25.174
No! No way! You're a pain!

15:25.257 --> 15:26.675
No, don't say that!

15:26.759 --> 15:29.136
Please let me tag along.
I'll do whatever you say!

15:29.219 --> 15:31.180
Hey! Nikaido!

15:31.263 --> 15:34.183
You're much better at this than me! Help!

15:34.266 --> 15:37.895
You damn piece of scum,
you need to pay me what you owe!

15:37.978 --> 15:39.063
[straining]

15:39.146 --> 15:40.564
[music ends with a flourish]

15:47.863 --> 15:49.573
Dokuga. Over there.

15:55.120 --> 15:55.955
[Dokuga] Kento...

15:56.038 --> 15:59.500
He must've turned into a giant
using the magic from the smoke shop.

15:59.583 --> 16:02.544
[Tetsujo] Dokuga!
This is bad. Everyone's dead!

16:07.299 --> 16:09.635
[Dokuga] This car belongs
to En's cleaners.

16:10.928 --> 16:13.097
That's who took out Kento and the others.

16:13.180 --> 16:15.182
[Tetsujo] Damn it!
What the hell's going on?

16:15.683 --> 16:18.018
Everything here went up in flames!

16:18.686 --> 16:19.853
[pan sizzling]

16:19.937 --> 16:22.898
Look, you said you had food,
so that's why I came over,

16:22.982 --> 16:24.817
but all you have is cold rice!

16:24.900 --> 16:28.612
Aw, come on. It's not all bad.
Anyway, Nikaido's cooking!

16:28.696 --> 16:31.740
So, tell me.
How do we get to Berith, then?

16:31.824 --> 16:34.118
[Natsuki] Well,
maybe we should take a bus.

16:34.201 --> 16:37.121
We could ride to Zagan City
and decide the next step from there.

16:37.204 --> 16:39.248
Oh? Zagan City?

16:39.748 --> 16:41.125
- [Nikaido] Food's up!
- Oh!

16:41.208 --> 16:44.128
[Nikaido] Omurice
with hardly any filling at all!

16:44.211 --> 16:47.631
Ooh! Simple, nice! [chuckles]

16:47.715 --> 16:50.509
So, how come
you're totally broke, Big Bro?

16:50.592 --> 16:52.136
I'm not your Big Bro!

16:52.720 --> 16:55.139
Hey, I wanna use your bathroom.
Is that okay?

16:55.222 --> 16:56.640
Sure. Over there.

16:56.724 --> 16:57.891
[door closes]

16:57.975 --> 17:00.144
- [Caiman] Mm!
- [Natsuki] Hey, Big Bro.

17:00.227 --> 17:01.812
- Hmm?
- So tell me about Nikaido.

17:01.895 --> 17:04.189
Is she your partner, then? Or your lover?

17:04.273 --> 17:08.110
[shocked grunt] Uh...
Well, She's my partner.

17:08.610 --> 17:11.572
Oh... But she's not
with the Cross-Eyes, right?

17:12.656 --> 17:16.076
[Nikaido] There's not even a trace left
of the wound I got in the church.

17:16.702 --> 17:18.787
Did Asu heal it for me?

17:19.747 --> 17:21.081
Well, either way,

17:21.915 --> 17:25.586
it doesn't answer whoever it was
that stabbed me in the first place.

17:25.669 --> 17:27.171
[pensive music playing]

17:28.172 --> 17:31.800
Oh, by the way,
I wanna leave this with you, Big Bro.

17:31.884 --> 17:33.260
Huh? What's that, then?

17:33.343 --> 17:35.971
[chuckling] You're so funny!
It's the Black Powder.

17:36.055 --> 17:39.099
This one is genuine.
That's the very last bag.

17:39.683 --> 17:40.684
If you take this,

17:40.768 --> 17:42.478
then even somebody
who can't produce smoke,

17:42.561 --> 17:46.106
like me, of course, can become
a fully-fledged Sorcerer really easily!

17:46.815 --> 17:49.610
The boss who invented this stuff
really is something!

17:50.319 --> 17:51.612
THE TRAGIC TALE OF THE CROSS-EYES

17:51.695 --> 17:54.073
[Ushishimada] I've done it!
Our grand mansion is now complete!

17:54.156 --> 17:56.909
- [laughs wildly]
- [Saji] Hey! Ushi! Ton!

17:56.992 --> 17:59.411
Stop messing with the merch
from our side job.

17:59.495 --> 18:01.205
What are you gonna do
if we can't sell them?!

18:01.288 --> 18:02.456
What? Come on!

18:02.539 --> 18:06.168
This house was built using the envelopes
we already sweated over to make!

18:06.251 --> 18:07.628
It has a dreamlike charm!

18:07.711 --> 18:11.632
Over here's the kitchen.
And the bathroom is huge, like a spa!

18:11.715 --> 18:13.634
We have three sinks and three toilets,

18:13.717 --> 18:16.970
so there's no more need
to fight over them in the mornings!

18:17.054 --> 18:20.557
I see, so you're finally losing
your grip on reality.

18:21.058 --> 18:23.644
Anyway, Dokuga and Tetsujo are late back.

18:23.727 --> 18:26.313
Isn't today the day we get paid a visit?

18:26.396 --> 18:28.148
- [knocking on door]
- [all gasp]

18:28.232 --> 18:30.651
- [all whimpering nervously]
- [knocking on door]

18:30.734 --> 18:33.278
[woman] Hello!

18:34.696 --> 18:38.784
Oh, look! It's our favorite landlord!
You're looking as beautiful as ever!

18:38.867 --> 18:43.497
Oh my! Hearing that from a fine man
like you certainly makes my day!

18:43.580 --> 18:45.541
[laughing]

18:45.624 --> 18:47.543
But let's get straight to business.

18:47.626 --> 18:48.836
I need this month's rent

18:48.919 --> 18:52.297
as well as the last six months
you still haven't paid me yet.

18:52.381 --> 18:55.717
Now don't get me wrong,
I like you guys, I really do,

18:55.801 --> 18:57.678
but today's the day you pay what is owed.

18:57.761 --> 19:00.722
Ah well, Dokuga will be bringing you
the money soon.

19:00.806 --> 19:03.433
In the meantime,
Ushishimada here will keep you company,

19:03.517 --> 19:04.643
- [Ushishimada gasps]
- [landlord] Huh?

19:04.726 --> 19:07.646
Well, how can I say no
to a wonderful offer like that?

19:08.355 --> 19:09.690
[landlord laughing]

19:09.773 --> 19:12.734
It's so nice to see you, Ushishimada.

19:12.818 --> 19:15.237
Yeah, you too... missus.

19:15.320 --> 19:18.782
Oh, no, don't call me "missus,"
I'm single, silly!

19:18.866 --> 19:20.325
- [giggling]
- [Ushishimada groaning]

19:20.409 --> 19:21.702
A visitor? Good.

19:21.785 --> 19:23.954
Why don't you become my partner?

19:24.037 --> 19:25.080
You know, if you do,

19:25.164 --> 19:28.709
you won't have to pay rent
for as long as you live here! [chuckles]

19:28.792 --> 19:30.919
And as for those friends of yours?

19:31.003 --> 19:33.714
Not to worry,
I'll take care of them as well!

19:33.797 --> 19:35.632
- [chuckling nervously]
- [giggling]

19:35.716 --> 19:38.844
Although, I'm sure
Dokuga will be back soon.

19:39.344 --> 19:40.888
[Ton] It's Dokuga and Tetsujo!

19:40.971 --> 19:42.848
What!? Oh, they're back!

19:43.640 --> 19:46.977
Dokuga! We've been waiting for you!
You got the cash?

19:49.062 --> 19:50.314
[all whimpering nervously]

19:50.397 --> 19:53.066
Kento and the others
were wiped out by En's cleaners.

19:53.150 --> 19:55.319
The last Black Powder the boss made,

19:55.402 --> 19:57.404
even the expensive smoke,
all up in flames.

19:57.487 --> 19:58.947
Are you kidding me?

19:59.031 --> 20:00.908
So you're telling me
that our entire fortune

20:00.991 --> 20:04.203
is just those envelopes
we use for our side job?! [sobs]

20:04.286 --> 20:07.206
So does that mean
we have to leave this place as well?

20:07.289 --> 20:08.874
- Where's Risu?
- [Ton] Huh?

20:08.957 --> 20:10.334
You're supposed to watch him.

20:11.919 --> 20:12.920
[Risu] Damn it!

20:13.003 --> 20:15.088
Come on, there's gotta be something here!

20:15.172 --> 20:18.091
There must be a clue
about whoever killed me! [gasps]

20:18.175 --> 20:21.345
So is that your plan?
Steal something from my desk?

20:21.428 --> 20:23.347
Well, bad news for you.

20:23.430 --> 20:25.849
You're not gonna find
anything valuable there.

20:25.933 --> 20:28.560
I'm here
because you're not telling me everything!

20:28.644 --> 20:30.395
I need to know who killed me.

20:30.479 --> 20:32.022
Did the boss order it?!

20:32.522 --> 20:33.774
Or maybe

20:34.650 --> 20:36.944
it was you, Dokuga.

20:39.321 --> 20:43.742
You know, this isn't the first time
we've had a thief break into this house.

20:44.493 --> 20:49.039
Let me show you just exactly
what I did to him when I caught him.

20:49.998 --> 20:52.417
[Tetsujo] This is it... We're out of money.

20:52.501 --> 20:56.672
[sighs] We have no choice but to leave,
and each of us go our separate ways.

20:56.755 --> 20:57.798
Damn it!

20:58.298 --> 21:01.969
The five of us were supposed to stay here
and wait for the boss to return!

21:02.052 --> 21:04.429
- We've lost to poverty.
- [frustrated groan]

21:04.930 --> 21:06.598
[Ushishimada] Don't worry. Leave it to me.

21:06.682 --> 21:07.641
[all] Huh?

21:07.724 --> 21:10.269
[Ushishimada] I will go
and live with the landlord.

21:10.852 --> 21:14.648
If I do that, then the rest of you
can stay here and live rent free!

21:14.731 --> 21:17.859
Don't be an idiot!
As if we'd let you do something like that!

21:17.943 --> 21:19.236
It's my choice!

21:19.736 --> 21:22.656
So then, if giving myself helps you all,

21:23.365 --> 21:25.492
then I'll gladly sacrifice myself.

21:26.410 --> 21:27.786
Ushishimada...

21:28.620 --> 21:30.247
You're so incredibly brave.

21:30.330 --> 21:33.917
What's going on out here?
Do you have the money or not?

21:34.001 --> 21:37.629
[Ushishimada breathes shakily]
Landlord... I'm sorry, but we don't.

21:38.130 --> 21:40.257
But I have decided to go with you instead.

21:40.340 --> 21:41.717
Oh my!

21:41.800 --> 21:43.135
[yelling angrily]

21:43.218 --> 21:44.636
[dramatic music playing]

21:44.720 --> 21:46.221
[grunts]

21:51.560 --> 21:52.728
[shocked grunt]

21:55.230 --> 21:56.815
[pained yelling]

21:56.898 --> 21:59.192
My eyes!
What the hell did you do to them?!

22:01.570 --> 22:03.196
My saliva is poisonous.

22:03.280 --> 22:05.032
[yells angrily, grunts]

22:07.117 --> 22:08.285
[pained groaning]

22:09.036 --> 22:11.330
[pained grunting]

22:13.415 --> 22:16.418
[breathing heavily, groaning]

22:16.918 --> 22:18.503
I won't kill you,

22:18.587 --> 22:20.339
because you're too "dangerous."

22:20.422 --> 22:22.591
[seething]

22:23.258 --> 22:24.509
[yells angrily]

22:24.593 --> 22:27.262
[landlord] This is the deed to the house.

22:27.346 --> 22:30.182
From now on, this building belongs to you.

22:30.682 --> 22:34.019
Right, then.
Shall we make our way home, Ushishimada?

22:34.102 --> 22:35.562
[laughs]

22:35.645 --> 22:36.772
And you know what?

22:36.855 --> 22:40.275
That envelope house we made
would have been perfect to call our home.

22:40.359 --> 22:41.443
Farewell.

22:41.985 --> 22:45.155
[all] Ushishimada!

22:45.655 --> 22:48.867
[landlord groaning painfully]

22:54.873 --> 22:55.749
[gasps]

22:57.209 --> 22:58.835
EAST BERITH

23:04.883 --> 23:09.221
[Caiman] Zagan... I'm sure
I've heard that name somewhere before.

23:09.304 --> 23:11.807
Just where on earth was it?

23:12.307 --> 23:13.141
ZAGAN MAGIC TRAINING

23:13.225 --> 23:14.142
[gasps]

23:17.396 --> 23:22.025
Professor Kasukabe. I became a Sorcerer.

23:22.943 --> 23:25.362
- [Shin] Hey, Kasukabe.
- Uh... Huh?

23:25.445 --> 23:28.198
You spaced out there. Are you okay?

23:28.281 --> 23:29.866
Are you still in some pain?

23:29.950 --> 23:32.452
No, I'm okay, thanks.

23:32.994 --> 23:35.372
- That wax figure...
- [Shin] Wax figure?

23:35.455 --> 23:36.623
Mm-hmm.

23:36.706 --> 23:38.708
There was something like an altar,

23:38.792 --> 23:41.753
and right there in the center of it
was this wax figure.

23:42.379 --> 23:44.965
Although, unfortunately,
it melted in the fire.

23:45.465 --> 23:49.010
By the way, those guys
with the cross marks on their eyes...

23:49.094 --> 23:50.846
Are they some sort of organization?

23:50.929 --> 23:52.472
Yeah, they're our enemies.

23:52.556 --> 23:54.516
We've taken out
quite a few of them, though.

23:54.599 --> 23:57.060
Caiman has that cross mark as well.

23:57.144 --> 24:00.021
Huh? What? Oh yeah! [whimpers]

24:00.730 --> 24:04.484
That is important,
but the face of that wax figure...

24:05.694 --> 24:07.404
It's funny, but I know him.

24:07.487 --> 24:08.405
[both] Huh?!

24:09.656 --> 24:12.033
Let's go back to the Hole.

24:13.910 --> 24:15.871
[Japanese theme song playing]

25:41.665 --> 25:42.916
THE END

25:42.999 --> 25:45.335
[narrator] What we learned in episode 14.

25:45.418 --> 25:47.087
Kasukabe's wife is a devil.

25:47.170 --> 25:49.172
The guys from the Cross-Eyes
are flat broke.

25:49.256 --> 25:51.216
Zagan exists in Caiman's memories.

25:51.299 --> 25:55.637
What we're going to learn in Episode 15,
it's still... lost in chaos.

25:55.720 --> 25:57.931
This is... Dorohedoro!
